<title>USA: Capital Corp files for share offering.</title>
<headline>Capital Corp files for share offering.</headline>
<dateline>MERCED, Calif. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capital Corp of the West said Thursday it filed a registration statement for the offering of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to raise about $17 million in the offering, which is being underwritten by Sutro &amp; CO.</p>
